        <div class="faq-answer">
          <div class="faq-answer-inner">Most residential inspections take 30 to 60 minutes depending on the size and pitch of the roof. Commercial properties or larger multi-story homes tend to take just a little bit longer than that. Either way, you'll have the written report in your inbox within 24 hours.</div>
