        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <div class="faq-answer-inner">It might be helpful, but it's not required. If you're there, our inspector can walk you through the findings right then and there and answer any questions you may have. That said, if you can't be home, we'll of course still conduct the inspection and send you the full report afterward.</div>
