          <div class="faq-answer-inner">Absolutely. If we find storm damage or other covered issues, we'll document everything with photos and written details that your adjuster can work from directly. We work with all major Florida insurance carriers and can meet with your adjuster on-site if that helps. On the other hand, if you're buying or selling a home, a professional inspection can give buyers confidence in what they're purchasing and give sellers a chance to address anything before it becomes a negotiating issue at closing. For insurance renewals, we can also provide wind mitigation and 4-point inspection documentation if your carrier requires it.</div>
